<title>SINGAPORE: IMM Multi-Enterprise returns to the red.</title>
<headline>IMM Multi-Enterprise returns to the red.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
